libsmb2: the SMB2/3 client library Immuch360 uses to open SMB shares

Immuch360 carries libsmb2 as a separate shared library that the dart_smb2
package loads at run time: libsmb2.so on Android and Linux, libsmb2.dll on
Windows, libsmb2.framework on iOS and macOS.

